  "system": {
    "biography": "<p>Strice Foods' Security Director contact — and <strong>the man Craft is blackmailing</strong>, which is how the insect Hive got its foothold in a Strice facility.</p><p>Not a combatant: Defense pools of 1, no gear, no weapons. He is an interrogation and social encounter, not a fight.</p><p><strong>If a Matrix Trace succeeds</strong>, the result prints at his terminal and he calls Lone Star — immediately if he is in-office by day, otherwise the next morning.</p><p><em>Queen Euphoria p.38. No actor previously existed.</em></p>",
